./docs/mcp.md-57-## Limits and troubleshooting
./docs/mcp.md-58-
./docs/mcp.md-59-This release supports stdio only and serves the current local working directory. It does not provide a remote endpoint or authentication. If the client cannot start DevX, check that `devx` is on the client process PATH and that the .NET tool is installed. If search returns no useful matches, run `devx index .` in the target repository and restart the client session.
