./docs/packaging.md-30-
./docs/packaging.md-31-This produces a 20.4 MB binary and `--version` runs in about 0.01 s. Real commands such as `mcp serve` and `search` crash at runtime with “Reflection-based serialization has been disabled.” The release measurement identified reflection-based System.Text.Json use in `SqliteSessionStore.cs:231` and other session-store code, along with IL2026/IL3050 warnings in `ProtocolEngine.cs` and the session store. Microsoft.CodeAnalysis (Roslyn) is also not trim/AOT friendly. The blockers are source-generated System.Text.Json metadata across the codebase and Roslyn compatibility, requiring a larger refactor.
