./docs/reporting.md-3-Reporting remains local and offline. Organization aggregation is a preview, not authenticated governance.
./docs/reporting.md-4-
./docs/reporting.md:5:```sh
./docs/reporting.md-6-devx report html --period 30d --output report.html
./docs/reporting.md-7-devx report export --period 60d --output worktree-a.json
./docs/reporting.md-8-devx report html --input worktree-a.json --input worktree-b.json --output project.html
./docs/reporting.md-9-devx read method 'db.example' --session "$SESSION_ID" --agent deepseek --task brief-054
